.Sh BUGS
Report issues at the project's source repository. Known limitations:
.Bl -bullet
.It
Windows is not supported.
.Nm
is POSIX-only; macOS and Linux are tier-1 platforms.
.It
Per-subcommand man pages
.Po Nm mkit-commit 1 Pc
are not yet shipped.
.Nm mkit Fl Fl help
is authoritative for subcommand synopses.
.El
